        <div class="rules-assistant-body"><p id="rules-assistant-detail" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="rules-assistant-actions"><button id="rules-assistant-cancel" hidden>Use basic rules now</button><button id="rules-assistant-retry" class="ghost tiny">Retry / re-read cards</button></div><small>Model interpretations can be wrong. Check Oracle text for complex interactions.</small></div>
