    <div class="ft-wrap">
      <div class="ft-side">
        <header class="ft-head">
          <span class="selection-kicker">PLAY WITH FRIENDS · 2–4 PLAYERS</span>
          <h1 id="friend-heading" tabindex="-1">Gather <em>your table.</em></h1>
          <p class="lobby-intro">One of you hosts and shares a code. Everyone else joins with it, on any device. Empty seats can be AI.</p>
        </header>
        <p class="lobby-offline" data-offline-note hidden>You’re offline. Friend games need an internet connection.</p>
        <div class="ft-rejoin" id="ft-rejoin" hidden></div>
        <div class="ft-me">
          <span class="ft-me-art" id="ft-me-art" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <label class="ft-name" for="friend-name"><small>Playing as</small><input id="friend-name" data-player-name maxlength="60" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="Your name"/></label>
          <div class="ft-me-deck"><small>Bringing</small><p class="lobby-deck-summary"></p></div>
          <button class="glass tiny" data-lobby-go="decks">${fe("swap",14)}<span>Change</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="ft-start" id="ft-start">
          <article class="ft-card ft-host" aria-labelledby="ft-host-title">
            <span class="ft-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">${fe("crown",22)}</span>
            <div class="ft-card-copy"><h2 id="ft-host-title">Host a table</h2><p>You get a code to share. Up to three friends can join, then you start the game.</p></div>
            <button id="m-host" class="primary ft-go">Create table</button>
          </article>
          <article class="ft-card ft-join" aria-labelledby="ft-join-title">
            <span class="ft-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">${fe("arrow",22)}</span>
            <div class="ft-card-copy"><h2 id="ft-join-title">Join a table</h2><p>Type the code your friend shared, or just open their invite link.</p></div>
            <div class="join-controls"><input id="join-code" placeholder="NOVA-EMBER-4821" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Friend code" maxlength="60"/><button id="m-join" class="primary">Join</button></div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <section class="ft-panel" id="ft-table" hidden aria-labelledby="ft-table-title">
          <span class="selection-kicker ft-role" id="ft-role">YOUR TABLE</span>
          <h2 id="ft-table-title">Waiting for friends</h2>
          <p class="ft-note" id="ft-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div class="ft-code" id="ft-code-box">
            <small>Friend code</small>
            <b id="ft-code" translate="no">—</b>
            <div class="ft-code-actions"><button class="glass tiny" id="ft-copy" type="button">${fe("copy",15)}<span>Copy code</span></button><button class="glass tiny" id="ft-link" type="button">${fe("link",15)}<span>Copy invite link</span></button><button class="glass tiny" id="ft-share" type="button" hidden>${fe("share",15)}<span>Share</span></button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ft-actions"><button id="m-start-table" class="primary" type="button">Start game</button><button id="m-cancel-table" class="glass" type="button">Close table</button></div>
          <label class="ft-ai" for="ft-ai-diff" id="ft-ai-level"><span>AI players are</span><select id="ft-ai-diff" data-ai-difficulty>${S_}</select></label>
          <div class="ft-format" id="ft-format"><label class="ft-ai" for="ft-mode"><span>Format</span><select id="ft-mode"><option value="commander">Commander (your decks)</option><option value="standard">Random Standard</option><option value="sealed">Sealed</option><option value="draft">Booster draft</option></select></label>
            <label class="ft-ai" for="ft-source" id="ft-source-row" hidden><span>Packs from</span><select id="ft-source"><option value="set">Latest set</option><option value="vault">Vault pool (works offline)</option>${Hde()}</select></label>
            <label class="ft-ai" for="ft-timer" id="ft-timer-row" hidden><span>Pick timer</span><select id="ft-timer"><option value="0">None</option><option value="45">45 seconds</option><option value="75">75 seconds</option></select></label></div>
          <label class="ft-ai check" id="ft-mulligan"><input type="checkbox" data-friendly-mulligan/><span>Friendly mulligan: redraw seven, nothing to the bottom</span></label>
          <label class="ft-ai check" id="ft-idle" title="Someone who stops responding is passed for, so the table keeps moving"><input type="checkbox" data-idle-protection/><span>Idle protection: a stalled turn or choice asks “Still there?”, then moves on</span></label>
        </section>
        <details class="ft-help">
          <summary>${fe("help",16)}<span>Trouble connecting?</span></summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Everyone needs the same version: reload the page if a friend gets a “versions differ” message.</li>
            <li>VPNs, mobile data and office Wi-Fi often block direct connections. The game then plays through the <b>encrypted relay</b> by itself (the connection badge says so); it takes a few seconds longer to join. Check it's on in <button type="button" class="link-button" data-lobby-go="settings" data-settings-tab="friends">Settings → Friends</button>.</li>
            <li>Open the game over <b>https</b> (the published site): browsers only allow the relay's encryption on secure pages.</li>
            <li>If someone drops out, the table waits for them and they reconnect by themselves. A reloaded tab rejoins from here. The host can also hand a missing seat to the AI.</li>
          </ul>
        </details>
      </div>
      <div class="ft-stage">
        <div class="ft-felt" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ft-felt-ring"></span><span class="ft-felt-copy"><b id="ft-felt-count">4</b><small id="ft-felt-label">seats at your table</small></span></div>
        <ol id="m-lobby" class="ft-seats" aria-label="Seats"></ol>
        <p class="ft-stage-note">Seats fill in the order friends join. Turns go clockwise from the host.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
